		"devdoc": {
			"details": "Solves the real-world problem of micropayments for digital goods. This contract allows a service provider (owner) to charge users a small, per-use fee from their deposited balance. This is only economically viable on a low-fee L2 like Base.",
			"errors": {
				"OwnableInvalidOwner(address)": [
